Here's my advice:

> Wands 1 Death (2:5), Many tele and digging at castle and lev 2 stash,

You'll need a way to find the secret door into the inner sanctum, best
bet is wand of secret door detection but the bell of opening will work
also but you may need to recharge it.  I would agree with the other
posters that teleporting to the left side of the bottom level is
best.  Just go down the stairs and come back up; then read a cursed
scroll (with TC) down to the bottom level.  I've even been fortunate
to land in the room with the High Priest!  Kill the priest, take the
amulet and c!oGL back out.  Don't forget the amulet (it does happen)!

Have a way to escape from summoning storms on the ascension run,
either teleport, wand of digging or Elbereth.  Nasties can be
surprisingly deadly.

For the ascension run, I'd recommend teleporting your way back out
using your spare scrolls of teleport and spare wand zaps.  Basically 2
of 3 attempts fail while you have the amulet plus the mysterious force
may make you repeat levels.

You will need a way to kill the riders.  5 zaps from the wand may be a
bit shy if you have to visit multiple altars.

One helpful trick that I learned was to use !oParalysis while wearing
a ring of free action.  Weild it, hit Rodney, and leave the level.
It's absolutely beautiful.

Good luck, good skill!
